  "status": "verified-sample",
  "coverage": "complete",
  "notes": [
    "Protocol: official EventMaster JSON-RPC API. The older XML protocol is a different module (barco-eventmaster-xml).",
    "All preset, source, destination, cue and layer dropdowns are filled from the connected frame (choices are device data, not enumerable offline). Ids are the frame internal ids, not the numbers shown in the GUI.",
    "Dropdowns without a default in the source are marked required.",
    "Companion module version 5.0.0 in package.json while companion/manifest.json carries the placeholder 1.0.0."
  ],
